#{\footnote # connecting}${\footnote $ Connecting}K{\footnote K Connecting}+{\footnote + procedures:010}
\pard\sb120\sa120\li120{\b\fs28 Connecting}\par
\pard\li120\sa60\sb60{\b To connect}\par
\pard\li360\fi-240\sa60 1.\tab From Settings, choose Communications and set the port and line settings the other computer uses.\par
2.\tab Set the phone number and choose Dial from the Phone menu, or simply type if a cable connects the computers.\par
\pard\li120\sa120 Hangup ends the call.\par
\page
#{\footnote # text_transfers}${\footnote $ Sending and Receiving Text}K{\footnote K Sending and Receiving Text}+{\footnote + procedures:020}
\pard\sb120\sa120\li120{\b\fs28 Sending and Receiving Text}\par
\pard\li120\sa120 Send Text File sends a file as if typed. Receive Text File saves the incoming text to a file until you choose Stop.\par
\page
